## Verification

```bash
cd /Users/prateekranka/Cowork/BillBandit-published
npm install
npm run db:generate
npm run typecheck
npm run build
npm run dev   # GET http://localhost:3000/api/health → 200
```

## Railway cutover (human ops — do not run from Lane A)

1. Add GitHub secrets to `shewhoknows/BillBandit`: `RAILWAY_TOKEN`, `RAILWAY_SERVICE_ID`, `RAILWAY_ENVIRONMENT`, `RAILWAY_PROJECT_ID` (copy from FairShare repo settings).
2. In Railway dashboard: point the existing `billbandit-api` service source repo to `shewhoknows/BillBandit` / `main` (same project, DB, custom domain `billbandit-api.contenthelper.in`).
3. Confirm env vars: `DATABASE_URL`, `MOBILE_JWT_SECRET`, `IOS_BUNDLE_ID`, Pusher vars.
4. Disable FairShare repo deploy workflow or disconnect Railway from FairShare `main`.
5. Push to BillBandit `main` and verify `/api/health` commit SHA matches GHA run.
